  "title": "Bolo de Banana Caramelizada (Caramelized Banana Cake)",
  "description": "Put your overripe bananas to good use with this Brazilian recipe for a caramelized upside-down cake that will wow guests at a dinner party.",
  "authors": [
    "rbdemedeiros"
  ],
